<title>MALAYSIA: RESORTS WORLD SIX-MONTH NET DOWN 10 PCT.</title>
<headline>RESORTS WORLD SIX-MONTH NET DOWN 10 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		282.17	vs    312.82</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   25.8	 vs     28.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,137.72	vs     1,118.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  396.32	vs	 437.67</p>
<p>    Dividend    (cents)     8.5	 vs	   8.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Resorts World Bhd operates Malaysia's sole casino.</p>
<p>It is 54 percent owned by Genting Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
